The vendored SKILL.md files and their references/, assets/ and scripts/
subdirectories are copied byte-for-byte; no modifications are made to their
content. The only change is to file permissions, normalised to 0644 — upstream
ships nine files with the executable bit set, including plain Markdown, and
nothing invokes them as ./script. The per-file SHA-256 digests recorded in each
plugin's .source.json make the byte-for-byte claim verifiable.

